Optical Fabric
Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs.

Optical Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for governing optical
connectivity and optical path state as an explicit control-plane boundary.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Optical Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

All optical devices, signals, and observations in this distribution are
synthetic unless a deployment explicitly supplies real evidence through the
documented typed interfaces. Optical Fabric never drives photonic hardware.

Optical Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
